      "date": "2026-04-24T09:50:00.000Z",
      "title": "Wendt (India) Limited Recommends Final Dividend for Financial Year Ended March 31, 2026",
      "body": "Wendt (India) Limited announced that the Directors have recommended a final dividend of INR 10 (100%) per equity share (on a face value of INR 10/-) for the financial year ended 31st March 2026. It may be recalled that an Interim Dividend at INR 20 per equity share was declared by the Board at its meeting held on 21st January 2026 and paid on 18th February 2026. With this recommendation, the total dividend for the year ended 31 March 2026 aggregates to INR 30 (Rupees Thirty Only). In line with the SEBI (Listing Obligations and Disclosure Requirements) Regulations, 2015, all the payments to Shareholders with respect to Dividends shall be made in electronic mode only. Accordingly, the electronic payment of the final dividend 2025-26, upon the approval of final dividend at the 44th Annual Gen",
